# Prompt pour Lovable

Build a clean, modern web application called "Reachizer — Content Engine". ## Brand & Design - Primary color: #885ad8 (violet) - Secondary color: #6161eb (blue-violet) - Background: #ffffff (white) - Text: #000000 (black) - Style: minimalist, tech, professional. Clean cards with subtle borders (#f0f0f0). No gradients, no heavy shadows. - Font: Inter - Language: French (all UI labels in French) --- ## Database — Supabase Create the following tables: **Table: clients** - id (uuid, primary key) - nom (text) - contexte (text) — full client context, plain text - created_at (timestamp) **Table: briefs** - id (uuid, primary key) - client_id (uuid, foreign key → clients.id) - titre (text) - description (text) - budget_ads (integer, nullable) - created_at (timestamp) **Table: contenus** - id (uuid, primary key) - brief_id (uuid, foreign key → briefs.id) - canal (text) - contenu (text) - created_at (timestamp) --- ## App Layout **Fixed left sidebar (220px wide):** - Top: "Reachizer" logo + lightning bolt icon in #885ad8 - "+" New brief button (primary color) - List of recent briefs from Supabase, sorted by date desc, clickable - Each item: brief title + client name badge + date - Active brief highlighted with #885ad8 background + white text - Bottom: "Gérer les clients" link **Main content area:** renders the active view --- ## View 1 — Dashboard (default) Shown when no brief is selected. **4 metric cards in a row:** - "Briefs créés" — count of briefs table - "Contenus générés" — count of contenus table - "Clients actifs" — count of clients table - "Canal le plus utilisé" — most frequent canal in contenus table **Recent briefs table:** - Columns: Titre | Client | Date | Contenus générés | Action - "Reprendre" button per row → loads brief in Production view - "Nouveau brief" primary button top right --- ## View 2 — Nouveau brief Centered form: - Dropdown "Client" — loads all clients from Supabase (displays nom, stores id + contexte in state) - Field "Titre du brief" (text input, placeholder: "Ex: OneDoc rejoint Google Maps") - Field "Description" (large textarea, placeholder: "Décrivez le sujet, l'angle, les chiffres clés...") - Field "Budget Ads (CHF)" (number input, optional) - Primary button "Sauvegarder et générer" → saves to Supabase briefs table → navigates to Production view --- ## View 3 — Production **Top brief recap card:** - Client name badge + brief title bold + truncated description + "Modifier" link - "Contenus générés : X/9" counter **9 generation cards — full-width vertical list:** Each card: - Left: label bold + short description grey 13px - Right: "Générer" button (#885ad8) - Below (hidden until generated): result zone + "Copier" + "Régénérer" buttons - If already generated (loaded from Supabase): show existing result directly Card list in order: 1. "Générer stratégie SEO/GEO" | "Architecture de contenu : cocon sémantique, H1/H2/H3, mots-clés cibles" 2. "Générer posts Meta organiques" | "Posts prêts à publier pour Facebook et Instagram" 3. "Générer post LinkedIn organique" | "Post B2B optimisé pour l'algorithme LinkedIn 2026" 4. "Générer un email pour ma base" | "Email prêt à envoyer : objet, preheader, corps, CTA" 5. "Générer stratégie Meta Ads" | "Variantes Feed Image, scripts Reels, recommandation budget canal" 6. "Générer stratégie Google Ads" | "RSA 15 titres, 4 descriptions, extensions, mots-clés négatifs" 7. "Générer stratégie LinkedIn Ads" | "Sponsored Content, Lead Gen Form, recommandation budget canal" 8. "Avoir une recommandation de budget" | "Répartition globale des canaux, plan de test J1-J15, signaux d'alerte" 9. "Générer des prompts pour visuels" | textarea BEFORE button: placeholder "Décrivez votre vision : ambiance, personnages, décor..." + "Générer les prompts" button **Loading state:** - Button disabled + spinner + "Génération en cours..." in result zone - If API call > 30 seconds: "La génération prend plus de temps que prévu... merci de patienter" **Result zone:** - Parse and display "response" field from API JSON as readable formatted text - "Copier" button - "Régénérer" button - Auto-save to Supabase contenus table (brief_id + canal + contenu) --- ## API calls Each button sends POST to its webhook with: json { "titre": "[brief title]", "description": "[brief description]", "budget_ads": [budget or 0], "contexte_client": "[full contexte text from selected client in Supabase]" } Webhook URLs: 1. SEO/GEO → https://reachizer-n8n.com/webhook/9ed7f30d-1ed1-4134-8cbe-c67cfcc766cb 2. Meta organique → https://reachizer-n8n.com/webhook/ec5eff15-f87d-4c2f-beec-0b6f726f02f5 3. LinkedIn organique → https://reachizer-n8n.com/webhook/cca0022a-928d-4dff-ad28-0ceaff6aa50a 4. Email base clients → https://reachizer-n8n.com/webhook/b5e3d4c5-d270-46e0-964d-012186b4c98c 5. Meta Ads → https://reachizer-n8n.com/webhook/3910a588-b23a-4e66-9118-a5673d37460e 6. Google Ads → https://reachizer-n8n.com/webhook/9d6d3128-91c1-4a49-8479-6ce7976df514 7. LinkedIn Ads → https://reachizer-n8n.com/webhook/ea1d1b49-24c1-47ed-8c89-455a935c716a 8. Budget → https://reachizer-n8n.com/webhook/d68f8b6b-3043-4b47-9791-49d257565d31 9. Visuels → https://reachizer-n8n.com/webhook/4f3ac35d-7df7-4ece-96e8-d1927312a2a7 For button 9 add to JSON: json "vision_visuelle": "[value from textarea above the button]" --- ## View 4 — Gestion clients Accessible from sidebar bottom link. - List of existing clients: nom + date création + "Modifier" + "Supprimer" buttons - "Ajouter un client" button → form: - "Nom du client" (text input) - "Contexte client" (large textarea — paste markdown or plain text describing the company) - "Sauvegarder" → saves to Supabase clients table --- ## Key behaviors - Brief data + selected client context persist in app state across views during session - Loading an existing brief from sidebar → pre-fills form + loads already-generated contenus from Supabase in production view - All data persists in Supabase across sessions

